      "fallbackReason": null,
      "text": "🔊 Spiritual insights drawn from Leader’s lessons published\n\n📌 Tehran, IRNA – The Telegram channel of the Leader of the Islamic Revolution has published spiritual and ethical insights drawn from lessons by Ayatollah Seyyed Mojtaba Hosseini Khamenei, under the title “The Best Deed Performed on Behalf of Another.”\n\nThe post, published on Friday night on the occasion of the martyrdom anniversary of Hazrat Fatima Zahra (PBHU), the daughter of the Prophet Mohammad, reads:\n​\n“A person came to Imam Jawad (PBUH) and said that whenever I go on Hajj or Umrah, I perform one circumambulation of the Kaaba on behalf of the Prophet, another on behalf of Imam Ali, and so on, until he mentioned the Imam himself. He then said that he does the same on behalf of the Imam’s mother, Hazrat Fatima Zahra (PBHU).”\n​\n“The Imam replied that the deed performed on behalf of Hazrat Siddiqah Tahereh (may Allah’s blessings be upon her) is superior to all of these.”\n​\nAccording to the Leader’s Telegram channel, the Rasm-e Bandegi (The Practice of Servitude to God) series features spiritual and ethical insights drawn from lessons by Ayatollah Seyyed Mojtaba Hosseini Khamenei, which will be published gradually by the media outlet of the Leader of the Islamic Revolution.\n\n📲 @Irna_en​",
